silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_02_typed_materialization_sections_02_manifest_structure_concrete_anchor#mittensgovernedindividual silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividual is the governed Mittens individual — the domestic cat at the Tartu Animal Clinic whose annual vet exam on 2026-05-18 produced the evidence chunk c-0x7f4a. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
