silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_02_typed_materialization_sections_02_manifest_structure_concrete_anchor#icechunkchunkc0x7f4a silm:hasLongDescription "The IcechunkChunkC0x7f4a is the specific Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a storing the Tartu vet-record payload for Mittens, dated 2026-05-18, with hash sha256:7f4a...bf2c, typed as evidence leg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'GraniteRow_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
