silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_02_typed_materialization_sections_02_manifest_structure_concrete_anchor#mittenssourcediagram silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensSourceDiagram is the source diagram D_Mittens: the functor from the index category of typed legs into G_Granite, whose colimit is the governed Mittens individual. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
