silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_02_typed_materialization_sections_02_manifest_structure_concrete_anchor#storagelegarrowsigma silm:hasLongDescription "The StorageLegArrowSigma is the storage/materialization leg arrow from the Icechunk chunk manifest to the Mittens apex in G_Granite — a one-way typed morphism, not an isomorphism. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'sigma', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
